{"id":"5cfc0a9f57224437","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-curvature.md","title":"Curvature","display":"df-curvature — Curvature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-curvature","aliases":["58-df-curvature"],"display":"df-curvature — Curvature","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-connection.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-curvature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-curvature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-curvature — Curvature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"904b0609d7cbf868\" href=\"?note=904b0609d7cbf868\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-connection.md\">../batch11/58-df-connection.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,\\tau,n\\in V\">\\(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,\\tau,n\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Curvature}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Curvature}_S\\)</span> 保留八元接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}\\)</span> 使用书内接口；下面要求同一丛记录的底流形记录恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span>，而非仅存在一个无关拓扑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Curvature}_S(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,\\mathcal A,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\;\\bigl[\nD=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Curvature}_S(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,\\mathcal A,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\;\\bigl[\nD=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将显示给出的底空间拓扑和维数绑定到计算曲率所用的光滑结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-connection.md","status":"resolved","id":"904b0609d7cbf868","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-connection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,\\tau,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Curvature}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Curvature}_S(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,\\mathcal A,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\;\\bigl[\nD=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R_\\nabla,\\nabla,D)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1070,"backlinks":[{"id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-389","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-curvature.md|58-df-curvature]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["904b0609d7cbf868","0e800aa519680c23"]}